{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026Qave5EB6Ib1793145595.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>ASMPT截至九月底止第三季度轉虧為盈，賺5.33億元，上一年度蝕近2.7億元。經調整經營盈利增長近3.8倍，超過9億元。主要受TCB、表面貼裝技術解決方案分部業務及光子帶動新增訂單總額創新高。而來自人工智能數據中心的強勁需求亦推動TCB晶片到基底的新增訂單創新高。</p><p></p><p>期內收入增長四成八，至超過52億元。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-28T01:01:30.418679+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":152,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-27T23:47:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-28T17:58:14.980971+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-28T00:58:34.026350+00:00","content_hash":"9b5effe74e9f9a4f27d8b0254062c36fd37cd23969204c2bf0742f581b92739c","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-28T01:01:30.418679+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}